  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programa Somos Defensores (We are Defenders Programme)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at fostering favourable and secure conditions for Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) to develop their work in Colombia, through four strategies: raising the visibility of problems and contributions of HRDs; fostering the influence of HRDs on human rights&#x2019; protection policies; strengthening human rights organizations to demand the enforceability of rights and provide direct protection to HRDs at risk; and strengthen the capacities of women and LGBTIQ+ organizations.

The project will have a national reach from Bogota and regional focus in Antioquia, Casanare, Cauca, Cesar, Choc&#xf3;, Magdalena Medio, Meta, Putumayo, and Valle del Cauca.</narrative>
  </description>
